at special book that kept the village safe for so many years. You have to stay alert and understand what the townsfolk are saying. You have to figure out who could have possibly done such a horrible act and doom the village. Emerge in this town, become its member and save the town. ", "short_description": "The clock is ticking and only three hours remain until the sun devours Arkala town. It is up to you to put on a cape and save these people. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.1neglakay.com/tomorrowends", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kadanss Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.1neglakay.com/tomorrowends", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "500276661658227"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974883_638856910759031_6930865527422337670_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ozPRBNU5IhsQ7kNvwGfIqtw&_nc_oc=AdpELK-Ikg-yFwWRtcMDO6XflSE1_GIWMKvMlroRMVviisOah0SLnDrFDU-8VUSn1e4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8YtUKdz5gDhTIuRcnjCiiOqk1P8I6phc2zhnDNKWHLSA&oe=6A22D626"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Tomorrow Ends", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": 